; 4_voice_get_ready — YM2149 envelope voice cue: "GET READY!"
;
; One syllable = consonant burst (preset 3 = tone+noise on ch A)
; + sustained vowel (preset 4 = tone-only on ch A).  Channels B,C
; stay silent (preset vol_b=vol_c=0) so the envelope-shaped channel
; A is what the listener hears, not chorus.  K0 retriggers shape $0
; (decay) on every note; Q sets envelope cycle per syllable.

T220
V14
O5

; "GET"  — sharp consonant + short rising vowel
Q3 K0
P3 D32
P4 G+16
R32

; "REA"  — sustained vowel
Q4 K0
P3 D32
P4 A8
R32

; "DY"   — descending close
Q3 K0
P3 D32
P4 E16
R32

; "!"    — short exclamation high
Q2 K0
P4 > C16

~
